### 8.2 Leakage and experiment reliability

| Concern | P1 evidence and severity | P2 evidence and severity | P3 evidence and severity |
|---|---|---|---|
| Chronological split | Correct expanding training slices with disjoint test windows; no separate untouched final holdout | Not applicable to deterministic formulas | No real split; future values used in display predictions: critical |
| Preprocessing leakage | Forward-fill is causal on sorted input; no global scaling/feature selection found. Do not score imputed target labels as observed truth | No learned preprocessing | Missing ML code prevents inspection; claimed test-set ensemble tuning compromises test independence |
| Timestamp alignment | Metrics compare arrays by position, not date labels; validator permits gaps: high for uploaded irregular data | No time index | Fixed generator dates; PDF omits forecast year and uses current report date |
| Overlapping windows | Test windows disjoint; training expands; no duplicated learned feature windows | Not applicable | LSTM windows only described; contamination cannot be assessed without trainer |
| Target leakage | No exogenous or current-target feature design beyond historic univariate series found | Not a prediction task | Explicit act→predicted array dependency |
| Model selection on test data | No tuning code; repeated UI backtest could become informal selection set | Strategy choice is scenario choice, not test accuracy | README explicitly proposes minimizing test MAE for weights |
| Horizon validity | Evaluates seven days; dashboard allows 7–90. No support for extrapolating verified results to 30/90 days | Static decisions/30-day liquidity scenarios; not intraday forecasts | 90D fixed arrays; selectors do not change horizon; “rolling” label unsupported |
| Calibration | Nominal SARIMAX/fallback 95%; no coverage evidence; daily-flow bands not balance-path probabilities | Stress parameters lack calibrated probabilities | Fixed bands, 93.8/95 claims versus 100% demo containment |
| Distribution shift | One synthetic seed and final 21-day season; generator payroll/month-end shocks not explicit SARIMAX regressors | Fixed returns/volatilities/funding and deterministic scenarios | Synthetic growth/calendar assumptions; no real-data result |
| Reproducibility | Clear generator and tests, but unpinned packages, unusable copied venv, missing statsmodels | Static formulas reproduce; CVXPY/solver missing; SLSQP fails in current host versions | Deterministic display math reproduces; genuine ML entirely unavailable |
| Correct units/objective | Local-currency MAE; MASE dimensionless; fee cash-budget issue | $mm/ratios; profit/RAROC distinction and accounting mismatch | Net/inflow/balance labels and sign formatting inconsistent |

**Hardware and cost:** executions used installed local CPU libraries, small in-memory arrays and tiny LPs; no GPU, paid service, download, package installation or full model retraining was used. P1/P2 specify no hardware benchmark. P3's Colab/free-GPU note cannot establish training hardware or run duration. No causal business gains can be inferred from these demonstrations.

