## 11. Reserve Juggler Relevance Assessment

Reserve Juggler requires **intraday timing and cash availability**, not merely a favorable daily net balance or strategic bank capital ratio. The Basel Committee explicitly distinguishes intraday liquidity monitoring from the calibration of LCR; P2's LCR should not substitute for intraday payout coverage. [BIS intraday monitoring](https://www.bis.org/publications/201304-standards-monitoring-tools-intraday-liquidity-management).

### 11.1 Independent reuse assessment

