| P1 | Data validation structure; ForecastResult interface; chronological evaluator; balance/shortfall/FX helpers; small LP constraint pattern | Seasonal-naive baseline and SARIMAX are legitimate candidates to evaluate. Current daily index, season=7 and net-flow target do not support intraday deposits/withdrawals directly | Daily settings, synthetic scales, demo FX and static maximum-shortfall LP cannot serve as intraday investment policy | Timestamped gross inflow/outflow history by account/currency; event cutoffs; intraday seasonal periods; separate flow forecasts; path-risk tests; treasury account connectors | **High overall**; low–medium for isolated utilities |
